# Default-deny build context: only application/build/migration inputs enter it.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!src/
!src/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**

# Exclude private/generated files even if placed under an allowed directory.
**/.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/data
**/secrets
**/private
